flowchart TD
    A[Worker Login<br/>/login?role=worker] --> B{Auth Check}
    B -->|Valid| C[Worker Portal: /worker]
    B -->|Invalid| A

    C --> D{Worker Dashboard Tabs}

    %% Digital Work Badge Flow
    D -->|Click Badge Tab| E1[Digital Badge<br/>/worker/badge]
    E1 --> F1[Load Badge Data<br/>GET /api/worker/badge]
    F1 --> G1[Display QR Badge<br/>Worker Photo, ID, Name]
    G1 --> H1{Action Buttons}
    H1 -->|Download| I1[GET /api/worker/badge/download]
    H1 -->|Refresh QR| J1[POST /api/worker/badge/refresh]

    %% Shift Schedule Flow
    D -->|Click Schedule Tab| E2[Shift Schedule<br/>/worker/schedule]
    E2 --> F2[Load Current Shift<br/>GET /api/worker/schedule]
    F2 --> G2[Shift Card<br/>Start Time, End Time, Department]
    G2 --> H2{View Options}
    H2 -->|This Week| I2[Display Weekly Calendar]
    H2 -->|Next Week| J2[Display Upcoming Schedule]
    H2 -->|History| K2[Past Shift Records]

    %% Gate Access History Flow
    D -->|Click History Tab| E3[Punch History<br/>/worker/history]
    E3 --> F3[Load Punch Log<br/>GET /api/worker/history]
    F3 --> G3[Timeline View<br/>Punch In/Out Records]
    G3 --> H3[Each Entry: Date, Time, Gate, Direction]
    H3 --> I3{Filter}
    I3 -->|Date Range| J3[Date Picker -> Refetch]
    I3 -->|Export| K3[GET /api/worker/history/export]

    %% Profile & Settings Flow
    D -->|Click Profile Tab| E4[Worker Profile<br/>/worker/profile]
    E4 --> F4[Profile Info<br/>Name, Dept, Contractor, Contact]
    F4 --> G4[Edit Profile Button]
    G4 --> H4[Form Modal -> PATCH /api/worker/profile]

    %% Notifications Flow
    C --> X[Bell Icon]
    X --> Y[Notifications<br/>Shift Changes, Alerts]
    Y --> Z{Click Notification}
    Z -->|Shift Changed| A1[Navigate to Schedule Tab]
    Z -->|Alert| A2[Show Alert Details]

    %% Logout Flow
    C --> B1[Profile -> Logout]
    B1 --> C1[POST /api/auth/logout]
    C1 --> D1[Clear Session]
    D1 --> A